  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Economic, Social, Cultural and Environmental Rights in C.A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ultimate goal of the project is to contribute to that in Central America and Mexico, the most vulnerable and excluded groups exercise their economic, social, cultural and environmental rights without discrimination. The Special Rapporteur of Economic, Social, Cultural and Environmental Rights of the Inter American Commision of Human Right will be implementing the project.</narrative>
  </description>
